\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. My spirit on Thy care,
\par Blest Saviour, I recline;
\par Though wilt not leave me in despair
\par For Thou art love divine.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. In Thee I place my trust,
\par On Thee I calmly rest;
\par I know Thee good, I know Thee just,
\par And count thy choice the best.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Whate'er events betide,
\par Thy will they all perform;
\par Safe in Thy breast my head I hide,
\par Nor fear the coming storm.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Let good or ill befall,
\par It must be good for me;
\par Secure of having Thee in all,
\par Of having all in Thee.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

